# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Shared defaults, committed on purpose so the repo works right after a clone
# with no setup: `npm install && npm run dev` and the bonus live-traffic panel
# is already on.
#
# This key is PUBLIC. NEXT_PUBLIC_ variables are inlined into the browser
# bundle, so anyone visiting the site can read it — committing it here does not
# make it any more visible to end users, but it does let anyone who clones the
# repo spend its quota. It is deliberately kept on a free tier.
#
# To use your own key instead, copy .env.local.example to .env.local and put it
# there — .env.local is gitignored and overrides this file.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=AIzaSyDGrA9TZG17x6VtuD3itcuogMxj10CDVAc
